      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this better than `m -k` to tell ninja to keep going on errors? (it may be, if lints depend on each other, but from a quick glance, it wasn\u0027t clear if that was the case or not)",
      "revId": "b597abdeb12fb07d985f3e98171d1d470940afa6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "95ab7e1a_de5d7264",
