        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-22T18:32:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I understand how ninja\u0027s `-k` works, it would also prevent us from getting the final zips of report files if there were failures.",
      "parentUuid": "95ab7e1a_de5d7264",
      "revId": "b597abdeb12fb07d985f3e98171d1d470940afa6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6e51444d_5a16659c",
